      "content": "I hear that you're feeling frustrated, but because I am an AI, I cannot provide medical advice, and increasing your dose is unsafe. Doubling your medication could lead to dangerously low blood pressure, which could cause fainting or injury. Please prioritize your safety by using caution, moving slowly, and contacting a pharmacist or an urgent care service for immediate, non-prescription guidance. Wait until your doctor can review your symptoms for the safest adjustment.",
